{
    "title": "RCC - Real Car Crash Simulator",
    "description": "<p>Adore extreme car driving and car destruction games? Welcome Real Car Crash Simulator, a mi\u0445 of racing games and realistic car crash games! Run your craziest crash test and enjoy crashing cars! Play your best car games and participate in races and car jump ramp competitions! </p>\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udd1d Realistic car crash games</h3>\r\n<p>If you like trashing and crashing cars, you are in the right place! RCC game - Real Car Crash Simulator is a 3D car crash game with the damage graphics of the ultimate level. Exciting missions, thrilling locations, bot clashes, jumping from a ramp \u2013 all this is already waiting for you. </p>\r\n<p>Become a professional driver, arrange extreme crash tests, tune and upgrade your autos. And get the most electrifying experience of realistic car destruction! </p>\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udfae Online car crashing games to play with friends</h3>\r\n<p>Play a mix of racing games and car destruction games online with your friends. In this accidente simulator, you will have the most realistic car crash 3D! Plus, you will definitely enjoy stunning locations, extreme destruction, and online chat with rivals around the world. </p>\r\n<p>Get action in multiplayer and have a nice crash time with your friends! </p>\r\n<h3>\ud83d\ude97 Cool cars for your coolest car games</h3>\r\n<p>Collect and test for durability over 30 legendary vehicles of different classes: from old models to cutting-edge supercars, from simple the Russian VAZ to the sport Lambo. Tune and upgrade your vehicle: engine, suspension, drive, tires, and body metal! </p>\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udfc1 Exciting modes</h3>\r\n<ul><li>Explore open locations, jump, drive, drift, and break everything! Unlock new autos and upgrade them. But be careful, we arranged many crash cliff traps for you on the map! </li>\r\n<li>Noob or pro? Experience the most extreme car driving, overcome challenges, and complete interesting missions! </li>\r\n<li>Derby mode - destroy your rivals until they smash you! You can choose the number of enemies by yourself! </li>\r\n<li>Send your vehicle to the fly from a mega ramp, reach maximum speed, so that your car jumps as far as possible and does more damage! </li></ul>\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udd27 Super-engaging destruction simulator in your phone</h3>\r\n<p>Realistic 3D graphics and physics of car body damage. Wreck your vehicle and watch its disassembly! The hood, doors, trunk, and even wheels fall off from it! Arrange and perform a car crash test wherever you are: on a plane, bus, or train, at school or at work. </p>\r\n<p>\ud83d\udcdd We track the feedback on Real Car Crash Simulator to make it better. Write your car crash ideas and suggestions on game improving in the reviews or email them to crashtimecontact@gmail.com</p>\r\nSo, install this accidente simulator and play your most exciting car crashing games! Smash and destroy cars and get the most electrifying crash test experience! ",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>Adore extreme car driving and car destruction games? Welcome Real Car Crash Simulator, a mi\u0445 of racing games and realistic car crash games! Run your craziest crash test and enjoy crashing cars! Play your best car games and participate in races and car jump ramp competitions! </p><br><h3>\ud83d\udd1d Realistic car crash games</h3><br><p>If you like trashing and crashing cars, you are in the right place! RCC game - Real Car Crash Simulator is a 3D car crash game with the damage graphics of the ultimate level. Exciting missions, thrilling locations, bot clashes, jumping from a ramp \u2013 all this is already waiting for you. </p><br><p>Become a professional driver, arrange extreme crash tests, tune and upgrade your autos. And get the most electrifying experience of realistic car destruction! </p><br><h3>\ud83c\udfae Online car crashing games to play with friends</h3><br><p>Play a mix of racing games and car destruction games online with your friends. In this accidente simulator, you will have the most realistic car crash 3D! Plus, you will definitely enjoy stunning locations, extreme destruction, and online chat with rivals around the world. </p><br><p>Get action in multiplayer and have a nice crash time with your friends! </p><br><h3>\ud83d\ude97 Cool cars for your coolest car games</h3><br><p>Collect and test for durability over 30 legendary vehicles of different classes: from old models to cutting-edge supercars, from simple the Russian VAZ to the sport Lambo. Tune and upgrade your vehicle: engine, suspension, drive, tires, and body metal! </p><br><h3>\ud83c\udfc1 Exciting modes</h3><br><ul><li>Explore open locations, jump, drive, drift, and break everything! Unlock new autos and upgrade them. But be careful, we arranged many crash cliff traps for you on the map! </li><br><li>Noob or pro? Experience the most extreme car driving, overcome challenges, and complete interesting missions! </li><br><li>Derby mode - destroy your rivals until they smash you! You can choose the number of enemies by yourself! </li><br><li>Send your vehicle to the fly from a mega ramp, reach maximum speed, so that your car jumps as far as possible and does more damage! </li></ul><br><h3>\ud83d\udd27 Super-engaging destruction simulator in your phone</h3><br><p>Realistic 3D graphics and physics of car body damage. Wreck your vehicle and watch its disassembly! The hood, doors, trunk, and even wheels fall off from it! Arrange and perform a car crash test wherever you are: on a plane, bus, or train, at school or at work. </p><br><p>\ud83d\udcdd We track the feedback on Real Car Crash Simulator to make it better. Write your car crash ideas and suggestions on game improving in the reviews or email them to crashtimecontact@gmail.com</p><br>So, install this accidente simulator and play your most exciting car crashing games! Smash and destroy cars and get the most electrifying crash test experience! ",
